{"id":"1fb25349289c3266","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-maximal-set.md","title":"Maximal Set","display":"df-maximal-set — Maximal Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-maximal-set","aliases":["68-df-maximal-set"],"display":"df-maximal-set — Maximal Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§17 final definition p.67 / PDF 76","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-maximal-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-maximal-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-set — Maximal Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§17 final definition p.67 / PDF 76"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 为可数无限基数。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Maximal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Maximal}\\)</span> 为以下引入的集合性质谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Maximal}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\bigl(A\\subseteq B\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus B|=\\aleph_0\\Rightarrow |B\\setminus A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Maximal}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\bigl(A\\subseteq B\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus B|=\\aleph_0\\Rightarrow |B\\setminus A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §17 末，印刷 p.67 / PDF p.76。与旧稿“任意 RE 超集要么仅有限增加，要么余有限”的形式等价；这里直接写出原书的 coinfinite 超集限定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。$\\aleph_0$ 为可数无限基数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Maximal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Maximal}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus A|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;\\bigl(A\\subseteq B\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus B|=\\aleph_0\\Rightarrow |B\\setminus A|<\\aleph_0\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1113,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd3e061b3fba7f3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Maximal}$ 见 [[68-df-maximal-set]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-maximal-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-maximal-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-maximal-set|df-maximal-set — Maximal Set]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039"]}